  m_text: "Build towers and docks along the Cothon to sink Rome's ships before they
    reach the Heart.\n\n\u2022 Select a building, then click the water or shore to
    place it (right-click cancels)\n\n\u2022 Click a placed tower to view stats,
    upgrade, or sell it\n\n\u2022 Pan with WASD / arrow keys, zoom with the scroll
    wheel, drag with the middle mouse button\n\n\u2022 Start the wave when ready,
    use the speed button to fast-forward, Esc to pause"
